  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 1.\tThe proposed two-storey rear extension would be in keeping with the surrounding area, with no negative effects identified on the street-scene or to neighbouring properties. However the extension, particularly with a converted loft space results in a four-bedroom house on the site. The loss of amenity space through the rear extension, combined with inadequate room sizes proposed within the layout of the design results in a property that fails to meet the minimum guidelines for amenity space and internal space provision and is contrary to policies ENV-B.1.1 and H.6.4. of the adopted Unitary Development Plan and the Supplementary Planning Guidance."
